                        "entry_id": "75522814-848b-3541-9fbe-9fe3bf0fc8fb",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Any of various invertebrate animals, such as jellyfish, hydras, sea anemones, corals and formerly sponges and ctenophores that belong to the phylum Cnidaria."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "bb1aa9a5-a8be-4f22-94ad-d895a4a86d1a",
                                "sense_id": "b8409275-a33a-3f54-a216-aeac6af82f3a",
                                "text": "A general feature of cnidarians, as I noted above, is their stinging cells."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
